1
00:00:46,240 --> 00:00:47,200
Back then,

2
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:52,679
we were just a ragtag gang following the Dragon-Seeking Clan.

3
00:00:52,679 --> 00:00:56,520
Seeing the ground covered in gold and silver treasures,

4
00:00:57,039 --> 00:01:00,520
thinking we'd make it big someday...

5
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,880
Tell me,

6
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:04,840
who wouldn't succumb to greed?

7
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,040
What happened next?

8
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,159
Then...

9
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:11,359
Then...

10
00:01:13,519 --> 00:01:14,760
Zhang Tianyou.

11
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:17,159
You say the Evil Entity I saw doesn't exist.

12
00:01:17,159 --> 00:01:20,680
Then what is the root cause of the tragic deaths of The Four Great Families?

13
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:27,640
It's all mine!

14
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,799
The root cause of all this...

15
00:01:38,799 --> 00:01:39,920
is actually

16
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:42,000
the mysterious illness you contracted in this tomb back then.

17
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,959
No.

18
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:45,640
No, no, no!

19
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:47,760
The sins you committed here,

20
00:01:48,719 --> 00:01:49,920
your greed,

21
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:52,480
your fear and selfishness...

22
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:54,519
That's the fate that led to all this.

23
00:01:55,159 --> 00:01:56,359
What's more terrifying is

24
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:59,760
that you even passed this mysterious illness to your descendants.

25
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,680
Impossible.

26
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:04,120
You're still lying to me even now.

27
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,480
Patriarch Mei.

28
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,040
Look for yourself.

29
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,199
Even at a time like this,

30
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:09,520
you still don't believe it?

31
00:02:16,639 --> 00:02:18,240
Gold with legs!

32
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:19,599
Come.

33
00:02:19,599 --> 00:02:21,360
Fenglin!

34
00:02:24,159 --> 00:02:25,479
Dad!

35
00:02:25,479 --> 00:02:26,319
Come!

36
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:30,520
The king's throne is mine!

37
00:02:31,159 --> 00:02:32,719
Fenglin!

38
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:33,639
Brother!

39
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,719
Chun'er!

40
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,759
Brother!

41
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:42,439
I am Destined by Fate!

42
00:02:42,439 --> 00:02:44,000
Destined my foot!

43
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:48,479
Chun'er!

44
00:02:48,479 --> 00:02:49,280
Brother!

45
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:51,560
Brother!

46
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,199
Brother!

47
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,800
Brother, wake up!

48
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:55,680
Brother!

49
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:00,319
Tell us now!

50
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,280
Miss Mei.

51
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:04,599
Fine.

52
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:07,319
Since you've always believed in the Evil Entity,

53
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:10,479
isn't the Evil Entity right here now?

54
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,319
No...

55
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:15,879
No...

56
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,560
Then...

57
00:03:21,439 --> 00:03:22,360
Then...

58
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,280
Dad!

59
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,319
Dad!

60
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,360
Then,

61
00:03:27,879 --> 00:03:29,879
we went into a killing frenzy.

62
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,960
We ignored the Zhang family's warnings,

63
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:38,080
and the Zhangs were forced into the fray as well.

64
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:43,639
In the end, only a few of us and Patriarch Zhang survived.

65
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:48,280
It was Patriarch Zhang, heavily injured,

66
00:03:48,879 --> 00:03:53,199
who dragged us out of here, one by one.

67
00:03:55,039 --> 00:03:58,159
When we woke up in the woods,

68
00:03:58,159 --> 00:04:00,680
Patriarch Zhang

69
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:06,520
was already lying on the ground, covered in blood.

70
00:04:07,879 --> 00:04:11,120
At the time, we saw the Book of Talismans and Incantations on him,

71
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,199
and the Celestial Seal.

72
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:19,680
Those are the greatest treasures in the world!

73
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:24,079
So we abandoned your father

74
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,800
and divided the treasures among ourselves.

75
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:31,160
He saved you,

76
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:35,319
yet you treated him like this.

77
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,600
Tianyou...

78
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,319
Later,

79
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:42,759
I turned back halfway on my own without telling them.

80
00:04:43,759 --> 00:04:48,519
But your father's body was gone.

81
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:50,759
I searched and searched,

82
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:52,920
but I couldn't find him in the end.

83
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:59,759
It seemed he was dragged away by wild beasts.

84
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:02,000
A momentary lapse in judgment...

85
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,199
Can't blame me.

86
00:05:05,959 --> 00:05:08,839
Can't blame me!

87
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,199
I'm begging you.

88
00:05:17,199 --> 00:05:18,959
Zhang Tianyou.

89
00:05:18,959 --> 00:05:19,279
Dad!

90
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:20,199
I'm begging you.

91
00:05:20,199 --> 00:05:20,839
Dad!

92
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:24,000
We elders committed these sins.

93
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:27,160
Please don't punish the next generation.

94
00:05:27,519 --> 00:05:31,160
All I want is the whole truth.

95
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:34,160
Zhang Tianyou, I'm begging you.

96
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,959
Hurry and destroy this place!

97
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:40,000
Destroy it! I'm begging you!

98
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:42,839
Dad!

99
00:05:44,079 --> 00:05:45,000
Dad!

100
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,160
Dad!

101
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:48,160
Nobody move!

102
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:53,879
The Evil God has already promised me.

103
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:57,199
He will grant me infinite power and authority.

104
00:05:57,959 --> 00:06:00,160
The Dragon Scale Armor is on her now.

105
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,560
Let's see how you block my bullets!

106
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:05,120
Cheng Xiao.

107
00:06:05,879 --> 00:06:07,680
Are you still unrepentant?

108
00:06:07,759 --> 00:06:12,800
All of this is just your greed.

109
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,079
There is no Evil God at all.

110
00:06:14,079 --> 00:06:14,759
Bullshit!

111
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,199
I won't be played by you again.

112
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:21,079
The Evil God has made a pact with me.

113
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:25,199
Soon, the whole world will be mine.

114
00:06:25,639 --> 00:06:26,519
Go to hell!

115
00:06:26,519 --> 00:06:27,319
Wait!

116
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,439
Li Xiao.

117
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:32,240
Do you really think the mysterious illness only infects The Four Great Families?

118
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,920
Did you forget?

119
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:37,319
Your father, Marshal Li, also went into the tomb back then.

120
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:39,279
You...

121
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,759
What do you mean?

122
00:06:41,399 --> 00:06:42,560
Think about it carefully.

123
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:48,680
Who killed your father in the woods just now?

124
00:07:01,519 --> 00:07:02,199
Son...

125
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:03,920
I... I'm your father.

126
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,399
Impossible.

127
00:07:13,680 --> 00:07:15,279
I couldn't have killed my father!

128
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,720
Absolutely impossible!

129
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,959
Stop talking nonsense!

130
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,279
Ling Yu!

131
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,480
Ling Yu!

132
00:07:33,199 --> 00:07:34,000
Ling Yu!

133
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:35,319
Ling Yu!

134
00:07:36,439 --> 00:07:37,240
Ling Yu!

135
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,360
Ling Yu!

136
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,480
Ling Yu!

137
00:07:52,399 --> 00:07:53,399
Zhang Tianyou...

138
00:07:55,079 --> 00:07:56,040
I...

139
00:07:56,399 --> 00:08:00,279
What the Sheng family and I owe you...

140
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:04,480
I...

141
00:08:04,839 --> 00:08:06,560
have paid in full.

142
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:25,759
Ling Yu

143
00:08:47,679 --> 00:08:52,240
Tianyou, I'm the only one left in the Sheng family.

144
00:08:53,639 --> 00:08:54,679
You'll protect me,

145
00:08:54,679 --> 00:08:55,480
won't you?

146
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:58,279
The Qi and Sheng families have redrawn their territories.

147
00:08:58,360 --> 00:09:00,799
What belongs to the Sheng family now is right here.

148
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:05,240
In the past, the Sheng family and I wronged you in many ways,

149
00:09:06,279 --> 00:09:07,960
and hurt your pride.

150
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:09,960
This is a letter of divorce.

151
00:09:11,519 --> 00:09:15,399
From now on, we have nothing to do with each other.
